{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> has remainder three when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> and remainder five when divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fb1d324dcbe00e34ae63ab8dad431052fbffd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />. \nThe remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is divided by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/2/aa22d7727c942a28b296c0eabc1b9fc1e27d3f76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x-1)(x-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/f/e9ffaa626d812968e2cb43dc52e86ea7f7c91764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }x-2\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }x+2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }8\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"427\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/f/77fbd4cc041104bb8e9afaa4683e19aedd0411a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(1)=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09f46853ff953cc5b8d16a7bc8f2dc8e5b12ed36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(3)=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"66\" height=\"18\" />. We write <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/5/2751d79d3bbfb34440d68c685fe6ba7414951749.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac4778cbc05d8547f7206209b935bcd4cc9fbcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p(x)=q(x)(x-1)(x-3)+r(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"258\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/1/26106c74520085037a7f2e6b3e4f87247d70a9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r(x)=ax+b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9b7652b7b0529cb87c5e97e883376f331b43cfd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/2/b022dc8ef6d33931fc1ae3d27df3ea0a81b52936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, we know <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/1/2c1d5eb6f9231ee01ee838cc4b09a87a5e32e2ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a+b=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"81\" height=\"14\" />. We have a systems of equations, where we can solve that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d65baaf9671227780dd04ab952911036aa5c868.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. So, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/5/be56999aa8fcfed39f91b601d8a5959d280cae7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1(x)+(2)=x+2\\Rightarrow \\textbf{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\" />. ~MathJams\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"1976_AHSME_Problems\">1976 AHSME Problems</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: 1976 AHSME Problems\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1977_AHSME\" title=\"1977 AH